{
"add"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Install and deploy the specified package"
,
"cn"
:
"安装部署指定 package"
}
,
"--prebuild"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Download and migrate the specified compiled and packaged package"
,
"cn"
:
"下载并迁移指定已经编译和打包好的 package"
}
,
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://pkg/data/sphere.args.jso"
}
}
,
"depend"
:
{
"dependent"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Find the dependencies of the specified package"
,
"cn"
:
"查找指定软件包的依赖关系"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://pkg/data/sphere.args.jso"
}
,
"dependency"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Search for packages that depend on the specified package"
,
"cn"
:
"查找依赖于指定软件包的 pkg"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://pkg/data/sphere.args.jso"
}
}
,
"sociality"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Set the environment configuration mode (sociality) for the specified pkg package"
,
"cn"
:
"设置指定 pkg 包的环境配置模式（sociality）"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"sociality 表示包的环境配置模式，可选值：\n1. app：缺省默认值（包 meta 未定义 sociality 时），隔离运行，不注入环境变量\n2. adaptive：链接 adaptive_shim_bin，shim 中的环境变量允许被用户环境覆盖\n3. intrusive：执行 boot 脚本向环境注入变量\n4. dev：adaptive + intrusive\n"
,
"en"
:
"sociality is the package's environment configuration mode. Available values:\n1. app: default; isolated, no env injection\n2. adaptive: link adaptive_shim_bin; shim env vars can be overridden by the user's environment\n3. intrusive: run the boot script to inject environment variables\n4. dev: adaptive + intrusive\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"生效时机：sociality 只在注册包时（use/try/link add）被读取并固化；\n修改后需重新设置，再 unuse（或 link rm）并重新 use（或 link add）才会生效。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Timing: sociality is read and baked in only when the package is registered (use/try/link add).\nAfter changing it, re-register the package (unuse/link rm, then use/link add) to take effect.\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"版本参数：version 可以为空，为空时自动使用该包的默认版本。\nset 按位置解析参数，省略 version 时需用 '' 占位，如 x pkg sociality set node '' dev；\nget 直接省略 version 即可，如 x pkg sociality get node。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Version argument: it can be empty, in which case the package's default version is used automatically.\nSince 'set' parses arguments positionally, use '' as a placeholder when omitting version, e.g. x pkg sociality set node '' dev;\n'get' can simply omit it, e.g. x pkg sociality get node.\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"取值优先级：link/path 的 --sociality 选项 > sociality set 的用户设置 > 包 meta.yml 的定义 > 默认 app。\nadaptive 仅在包提供 adaptive_shim_bin 时有效，否则回退到 shim_bin。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Priority: the --sociality option of link/path > user setting via 'sociality set' > package meta.yml > default app.\n'adaptive' only takes effect when the package ships adaptive_shim_bin; otherwise it falls back to shim_bin.\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x pkg sociality get node"
,
"en"
:
"Get the sociality of the default version of node"
,
"cn"
:
"查看 node 默认版本的 sociality"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x pkg sociality set node v20.11.1 adaptive"
,
"en"
:
"Set the sociality of node v20.11.1 to adaptive (take effect with env use/try)"
,
"cn"
:
"将 node v20.11.1 的 sociality 设置为 adaptive（配合 env use/try 生效）"
}
]
,
"get"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Get the sociality for the specified pkg package"
,
"cn"
:
"获取指定 pkg 包的 sociality"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://pkg/data/sphere.args.jso"
}
,
"set"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Set the sociality for the specified pkg package, [app|intrusive|adaptive|dev]"
,
"cn"
:
"设置指定 pkg 包的 sociality，[app|intrusive|adaptive|dev]"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://pkg/data/sphere.args.jso"
,
"#3"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"sociality value, [app|intrusive|adaptive|dev]"
,
"cn"
:
"sociality 值，[app|intrusive|adaptive|dev]"
}
,
"#cand"
:
[
{
"app"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Default, isolated state, dependencies are not affected by external environment variables, nor will they inject environment variables"
,
"cn"
:
"默认，隔离状态，依赖项不受外部环境变量影响，也不会注入环境变量"
}
}
}
,
{
"intrusive"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Attempt to execute the boot script, injecting influences on external environment variables"
,
"cn"
:
"尝试执行 boot 脚本，注入影响外部环境变量"
}
}
}
,
{
"adaptive"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Dependency is affected by user environment variables"
,
"cn"
:
"依赖项受用户环境变量影响"
}
}
}
,
{
"dev"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Development status, intrusive + adaptive."
,
"cn"
:
"开发状态，intrusive + adaptive"
}
}
}
]
}
}
}
,
"link"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Enable the pkg package globally by symlinking its shim executables into pkg's shared bin directory, which is already on the global PATH"
,
"cn"
:
"将包的 shim 可执行文件软链接到 pkg 的公共 bin 目录（该目录已在全局 PATH 中），全局持久启用该包"
}
,
"add"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Register the specified pkg package to the global environment"
,
"cn"
:
"将指定 pkg 包注册到全局环境中"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://pkg/data/sphere.args.jso"
,
"--sociality"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Set sociality for the specified pkg package, [app|intrusive|adaptive|dev]"
,
"cn"
:
"设置指定 pkg 包的 sociality，[app|intrusive|adaptive|dev]"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#cand"
:
[
{
"app"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Default, isolated state, dependencies are not affected by external environment variables, nor will they inject environment variables"
,
"cn"
:
"默认，隔离状态，依赖项不受外部环境变量影响，也不会注入环境变量"
}
}
}
,
